  description: '2 "Altergeist" monsters

    Gains ATK equal to the original ATK
    of each "Altergeist" monster it points to. When a Spell/Trap Card or effect is
    activated (Quick Effect): You can Tribute 1 "Altergeist" monster this card points
    to; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. If this card is
    sent from the field to the GY: You can add 1 "Altergeist" card from your Deck
    to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Altergeist Hexstia" once per turn.'
